{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t現任聯合國秘書長古特雷斯任期將於年底結束，預計接替人選將於12月正式宣布。現階段共有八人角逐，但據報仍未有候選人達到安理會推薦的門檻。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n早前一直有消息傳出，手握否決權的安理會五大常任理事國，出現意見分歧，當中美國一再有意打破地區輪換的不成文慣例，令遴選陷於罕見僵局。\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T05:41:45.655116+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T05:13:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T08:18:51.683912+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T05:38:35.008832+00:00","content_hash":"519f2ab25d68c30decda1dd21e7709b81d6effa2deb51df7a6cb8ade483a6080","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}